  [exempt file='cx-core-code/spec/03-approved/core/code.md' class=author match='Each remaining cell **MUST** have at least one fixture tagged' reason='an obligation on the corpus author; the 36 cells are program-matrix-001..036 (tagged composition-matrix, not resilience-matrix) and no step counts cells']
